Third-party dependency position
-------------------------------
The runtime of the best-offers service uses only the Node.js standard library
and therefore carries no third-party runtime licences. Build, deployment and
documentation tooling referenced by this repository (Node.js, Docker,
Terraform and the cloud providers' Terraform providers) is used unmodified
under its own licence; see docs/architecture/boundaries.md for the full
licensing position and the open-source policy proposed for the platform.
